================================================================================
Source code
================================================================================

All source code in this repository (crates/, scripts/, demo/) is original
work of COOLJAPAN OU (Team KitaSan) and is licensed under Apache-2.0.

OxiHuman is an independent, pure-Rust, Apache-2.0 implementation of a
parametric human body generator. It is format-compatible with MakeHuman: it
reads the documented `.target` and `.mhclo` file formats. It contains no
code copied, translated, or otherwise derived from the AGPL-licensed
MakeHuman Python application. See docs/CLEANROOM_AUDIT.md for the
verification methodology and findings supporting this statement.

